from the table since they were each named executive officers for 2025.&#160;&#160;Information regarding their respective ownership of
stock options and RSUs as of December 31, 2025 is set forth under the heading &#8220;Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year-End&#8221;
above.</p>

